[{"sha": "e57db758341a7387ae1551cf7d7e8c5c4600eff1", "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0MjM3OTA4MDgyOmU1N2RiNzU4MzQxYTczODdhZTE1NTFjZjdkN2U4YzVjNDYwMGVmZjE=", "commit": {"author": {"name": "sonyafenge", "email": "45471193+sonyafenge@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2021-03-13T02:56:20Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2021-03-13T02:56:20Z"}, "message": "Bump kube-openapi to 20200410 version and SMD to V3  (#1010)\n\n* Bump k8s.io/kube-openapi to v0.0.0-20200410145947-61e04a5be9a6\nUpdate structured-merge-diff dependency to v3\nUpdate all smd import code to v3\n\nhack/pin-dependency.sh k8s.io/kube-openapi v0.0.0-20200410145947-61e04a5be9a6\ngo mod edit -replace sigs.k8s.io/structured-merge-diff/v3=sigs.k8s.io/structured-merge-diff/v3@v3.0.0-20200116222232-67a7b8c61874\ngo mod edit -dropreplace sigs.k8s.io/structured-merge-diff\nhack/pin-dependency.sh github.com/json-iterator/go v1.1.8\nhack/update-vendor.sh\nhack/lint-dependencies.sh\n\n* make apiserver changes to integrate new structured-merge-patch\n\n* apiserver: wire OpenAPI into sample-apiserver\nFix scripts to not rely on codegen scripts being executable\n\n* Fix publishing x-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields working with kubectl\n\n* Test kubectl with x-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields\n\n* Use raw bytes in metav1.Fields instead of map\n\nAlso define custom proto unmarshaller that understands the old format\n\n* apiextensions: move openapi schema builder and merge code into package\n\n* apiextensions: builder for OpenAPI v3\n\n* add a test to make sure the CRD OpenAPI path and defintion are protected\n\nfrom user-defined CRDs\n\n* apiextensions: merge openapi spec ignore path conflict\n\n* Use CRD validation field in server-side apply\n\n* Fix validation and add many tests\n\n* Remove defaulting for x-k8s-list-type\n\n* fix nit\n\n* Apply current parses the yaml object 3 times\n\nThis is super expensive and not needed at all since we don't have to\nreparse the entire object. Remove all allocations but the first one.\n\n* Remove ineffective calls in toUnstructured\n\n* auto generated: hack/arktos_cherrypick.sh\n\n* add multi tenancy to build test\n\n* Pick up performance optimizations related latest SMD\n\n* Auto generated: make generated_files UPDATE_API_KNOWN_VIOLATIONS=true\nmake update\n\n* fix make update error: API rule violation\n\nCo-authored-by: Jordan Liggitt <liggitt@google.com>\nCo-authored-by: jennybuckley <jennybuckley@google.com>\nCo-authored-by: Dr. Stefan Schimanski <stefan.schimanski@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Haowei Cai <haoweic@google.com>\nCo-authored-by: Antoine Pelisse <apelisse@google.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ted Yu <yute@vmware.com>", "tree": {"sha": "e9acef458e7bfff133aedf12406937cbf458db8f", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/CentaurusInfra/arktos/git/trees/e9acef458e7bfff133aedf12406937cbf458db8f"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/CentaurusInfra/arktos/git/commits/e57db758341a7387ae1551cf7d7e8c5c4600eff1", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJgTCnUCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIAExas8rfyNe6djDyVUQKdvsh\nJ0XayxtCtDTbpC4Y0M/D3WV+8riy4jsbx+gYYW2paCMr/x5NXnLBNR58GyHVL8HQ\n0dmK3495Mrxx7oNLqb7Ne6I9EVPWUhhkHA943+pzq/LiQwAv67bKxZd8PuedxdEg\ntagxqnu5/3dcWsRfJus6NO1r8/bNXKGfLjYMTnxsJM9R5f33TQBGIpSLiVlXshQZ\nl5JxcxzBBPSfaOuOusfKWC26Kfa89L4rmzA9tj87Uc4u4Kx6v1fGY0ufO9zagtLn\nxfdNWe7QAFTDfUBcWwSNpP5MtMG5igKXVFPA7LBmAaXTnEk9906IUDMQMWXhiK4=\n=2rtK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree e9acef458e7bfff133aedf12406937cbf458db8f\nparent 945730d90a0f2efb56199814385006612903c79e\nauthor sonyafenge <45471193+sonyafenge@users.noreply.github.com> 1615604180 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1615604180 -0800\n\nBump kube-openapi to 20200410 version and SMD to V3  (#1010)\n\n* Bump k8s.io/kube-openapi to v0.0.0-20200410145947-61e04a5be9a6\nUpdate structured-merge-diff dependency to v3\nUpdate all smd import code to v3\n\nhack/pin-dependency.sh k8s.io/kube-openapi v0.0.0-20200410145947-61e04a5be9a6\ngo mod edit -replace sigs.k8s.io/structured-merge-diff/v3=sigs.k8s.io/structured-merge-diff/v3@v3.0.0-20200116222232-67a7b8c61874\ngo mod edit -dropreplace sigs.k8s.io/structured-merge-diff\nhack/pin-dependency.sh github.com/json-iterator/go v1.1.8\nhack/update-vendor.sh\nhack/lint-dependencies.sh\n\n* make apiserver changes to integrate new structured-merge-patch\n\n* apiserver: wire OpenAPI into sample-apiserver\nFix scripts to not rely on codegen scripts being executable\n\n* Fix publishing x-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields working with kubectl\n\n* Test kubectl with x-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields\n\n* Use raw bytes in metav1.Fields instead of map\n\nAlso define custom proto unmarshaller that understands the old format\n\n* apiextensions: move openapi schema builder and merge code into package\n\n* apiextensions: builder for OpenAPI v3\n\n* add a test to make sure the CRD OpenAPI path and defintion are protected\n\nfrom user-defined CRDs\n\n* apiextensions: merge openapi spec ignore path conflict\n\n* Use CRD validation field in server-side apply\n\n* Fix validation and add many tests\n\n* Remove defaulting for x-k8s-list-type\n\n* fix nit\n\n* Apply current parses the yaml object 3 times\n\nThis is super expensive and not needed at all since we don't have to\nreparse the entire object. Remove all allocations but the first one.\n\n* Remove ineffective calls in toUnstructured\n\n* auto generated: hack/arktos_cherrypick.sh\n\n* add multi tenancy to build test\n\n* Pick up performance optimizations related latest SMD\n\n* Auto generated: make generated_files UPDATE_API_KNOWN_VIOLATIONS=true\nmake update\n\n* fix make update error: API rule violation\n\nCo-authored-by: Jordan Liggitt <liggitt@google.com>\nCo-authored-by: jennybuckley <jennybuckley@google.com>\nCo-authored-by: Dr. Stefan Schimanski <stefan.schimanski@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Haowei Cai <haoweic@google.com>\nCo